      "id": "file:ffi/capi/lib.rs",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "lib.rs",
      "filePath": "ffi/capi/lib.rs",
      "summary": "C FFI entry point exposing a builder pattern for constructing and configuring Servo browser instances from C-compatible languages. Re-exports all C-ABI functions from submodules including options, preferences, rendering context, servo lifecycle, webview, and webview delegate management.",
